#: ../../getting_started/additional/ha_load_balancer.rst:4
msgid ""
"For configurations with 2 or more Applications Nodes, a load balancer is "
"recommended to ensure high availability (HA) from disruptions and "
"upgrades. Below are the guidelines to configuring a load balancer for "
"|morpheus| but each configuration may differ based on the organization's "
"requirements."
msgstr ""

